### 🛑 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Compiled binaries
*.out
*.o
*.exe
*.bin

# Default build artifacts
tcp_echo_client
tcp_echo_server
udp_echo_client
udp_echo_server
tcp_chat_server
udp_chat_server
client

# Makefile backup
*~

# Debug files
core
vgcore.*

# Editor/IDE files
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log
